       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TPCO10.
      * CDD DRIVER - PASSES THE COMPANY LIMIT TO THE SCREEN
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-COMPANY-LIMIT          PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 25.00.
       01  WS-STAKE-PCT              PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-OTHER-CONTROL          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-IS-BO                  PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-STAKE-PCT
           ACCEPT WS-OTHER-CONTROL
           CALL 'TPCO10S' USING WS-STAKE-PCT WS-COMPANY-LIMIT
                                WS-OTHER-CONTROL WS-IS-BO
           DISPLAY 'BO: ' WS-IS-BO
           STOP RUN.
